  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Multiple countries &#x2013; Programme evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This objective of this project is to conduct an outcome evaluation of the Orange Corners programme and the Orange Corners Innovation Fund (OCIF). The main goal of the evaluation is to understand what the main effects of the Orange Corners training programme and OCIF have been on its beneficiaries (young entrepreneurs) and their businesses three years after starting the Orange Corners programme and one year after completing the OCIF Track II support. The report should have a strong learning component and offer concrete recommendations that will aide in improving the Orange Corners and OCIF programme.</narrative>
  </description>
